# The direct copy on xeu loaded with rx_buf_size=4096 (four buffers to a
# 16 KiB page, three to a 9000-byte frame): 1024 ring entries hold about
# 341 frames, and the held buffer is 1 MiB scaled by the truesize of a
# frame (12544 bytes against 16640).
#     RX_LINGER_US=50 BALANCE=35 STEP_BS=8M STEP_JOBS=16 PRP_DIR=/hs/stripe/zcbudget TRIM=/hs/stripe
1024 790528 0 prp step-copy-n16
